flowchart TD
    CART["cart (Ch 38)"] --> STEPS["multi-step: address -> shipping -> payment -> review (server-validated each, Ch 53)"]
    STEPS --> KEY["generate idempotency key per attempt + persist (SSOT, Ch 3/8/15)"]
    KEY --> PLACE["Place order: send cart + options + idempotency key (authed, Ch 19)"]
    PLACE --> SERVER["server: authoritative price/tax/shipping/stock + charge via PSP"]
    SERVER --> PSP["PSP: tokenized charge + SCA/3-DS + async confirm (no card on device, Ch 23)"]
    PSP --> OUTCOME{result}
    OUTCOME -->|confirmed| CONFIRMED["real confirmed order (NOT optimistic, contrast Ch 72)"]
    OUTCOME -->|requires auth| CHALLENGE["SCA challenge via SDK -> confirm"]
    OUTCOME -->|declined/precise failure| FAILURE["precise, actionable error - no partial order"]
    INTERRUPT["process death mid-payment (Ch 8)"] --> RECOVER["recover: re-submit SAME key / query status - NEVER blind re-submit"]
    RECOVER --> SERVER
    CONFIRMED --> AUDIT["server audit trail (Ch 19)"]
